    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383340/extras/4f760c2ec5f0cc172b83e62754f1f5f3.poster.avif?t=1736562685\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383340/extras/4f760c2ec5f0cc172b83e62754f1f5f3.webm?t=1736562685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383340/extras/4f760c2ec5f0cc172b83e62754f1f5f3.mp4?t=1736562685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383340/extras/defb3627d0cc224d8b21e66c1fa44259.poster.avif?t=1736562685\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383340/extras/defb3627d0cc224d8b21e66c1fa44259.webm?t=1736562685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383340/extras/defb3627d0cc224d8b21e66c1fa44259.mp4?t=1736562685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383340/extras/55873464d032ad0d02a23f74a5825b49.poster.avif?t=1736562685\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383340/extras/55873464d032ad0d02a23f74a5825b49.webm?t=1736562685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383340/extras/55873464d032ad0d02a23f74a5825b49.mp4?t=1736562685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have crash-landed on a strange alien planet as a cicada, surrounded by a world teeming with giant insects and thriving fungi, waiting for you to explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive in this uncharted land, you must:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Explore the mysterious planet: Venture into unknown terrains to uncover rare resources and ancient relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Solve hidden mysteries: Take on puzzles to uncover the secrets of this alien world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Manage your survival base: Build, upgrade, and expand to create your safe haven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Gather and upgrade resources: Collect materials to enhance your base and gear, defending against unknown threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this dangerous yet beautiful world, strive to survive and find your way home! Can you unravel the secrets of this enigmatic planet?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383340/extras/4f760c2ec5f0cc172b83e62754f1f5f3.poster.avif?t=1736562685\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383340/extras/4f760c2ec5f0cc172b83e62754f1f5f3.webm?t=1736562685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383340/extras/4f760c2ec5f0cc172b83e62754f1f5f3.mp4?t=1736562685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383340/extras/defb3627d0cc224d8b21e66c1fa44259.poster.avif?t=1736562685\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383340/extras/defb3627d0cc224d8b21e66c1fa44259.webm?t=1736562685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383340/extras/defb3627d0cc224d8b21e66c1fa44259.mp4?t=1736562685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383340/extras/55873464d032ad0d02a23f74a5825b49.poster.avif?t=1736562685\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383340/extras/55873464d032ad0d02a23f74a5825b49.webm?t=1736562685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383340/extras/55873464d032ad0d02a23f74a5825b49.mp4?t=1736562685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have crash-landed on a strange alien planet as a cicada, surrounded by a world teeming with giant insects and thriving fungi, waiting for you to explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive in this uncharted land, you must:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Explore the mysterious planet: Venture into unknown terrains to uncover rare resources and ancient relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Solve hidden mysteries: Take on puzzles to uncover the secrets of this alien world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Manage your survival base: Build, upgrade, and expand to create your safe haven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Gather and upgrade resources: Collect materials to enhance your base and gear, defending against unknown threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this dangerous yet beautiful world, strive to survive and find your way home! Can you unravel the secrets of this enigmatic planet?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
